# Clauxen skills

Before non-trivial domain work in this repo, read the matching skill under `skills/` (also linked from `.cursor/skills/`):

1. Identify the domain (chat, auth, workers, billing, etc.).
2. Read `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` with the Read tool.
3. Follow its hard rules; open `reference.md` only if needed.
4. Still read `brain/MEMORY.md` at task start (brain-memory rule).

Catalog: `skills/README.md`.
